{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "f7cd8fa9-2e75-4ef5-86ef-2b6fedd5b7f6",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3164",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "你回来啦？我有一个好消息和坏消息。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 201.59999084472657,
            "positionY": 164.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "711eff00-4586-4403-8ffc-3b815f13a27d",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3165",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "嗯？怎么了？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 530.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 164.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "52937e05-cb92-4168-84f0-b8532db9c239",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3166",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "额，坏消息是我们道观大部分人手都被派出进行大会准备了，今晚是大会前夕嘛。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 848.7999877929688,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "01572a5d-d75d-419f-9133-30e9c95978e9",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3167",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "我把事情汇报给了师父，但现在实在抽调不出人手来帮我们。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1178.39990234375,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9359b916-2462-40af-9d94-b9862518de0c",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3168",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "这样啊......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1511.199951171875,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a6ac858f-19d4-4c71-8595-37acd1840f49",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3169",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "好消息呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1847.199951171875,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "db6b2eed-c633-495c-a791-fc46664061a0",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3170",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "好消息是师父告诉了我不少关于信息，最近市里不太平，道观也在观察那个什么极乐戏团。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2181.599853515625,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3f0bf276-e6f1-49ae-93a2-ced0344afeaa",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3171",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "而且师父破格把明镜继续借给我了！明早之前还回道观就行！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2500.0,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "efbd0176-7b2a-48b6-9245-277b33cd647b",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3172",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "好吧，既然只叫你过来，你师父应该很相信你的能力。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2832.0,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3ab01aa2-9d24-487c-bf0a-6009b1062bab",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3173",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "我刚才去摊位的时候也看到那个戏团的人了，衣着和之前我在飞机上观察到的人一摸一样。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3164.0,
            "positionY": 164.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7aed6ff1-1b4d-42dc-afef-e140d58316f9",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3174",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "嗯，我把你之前告诉我的事跟师父说了。他说飞机肯定混上了戏团的人。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3500.0,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "18f6d313-0925-4844-b3e4-02648280c883",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3175",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "师父说这个极乐戏团虽然近几月才出现，但使用的手段和本地喜母教派的信仰者却有些类似。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3818.39990234375,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9885c77c-4022-4cc0-8eac-34239cb47b36",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3176",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "额，不如说比之更邪性一点。最近这两个星期市内好像出现了不少奇怪的失踪案，有人汇报亲朋好友忽然消失，还有目击者见到熟人忽然像木偶一样反转了手臂，之后眨眼间就消失了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4149.60009765625,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8cbbd17d-4fa4-4dd3-8e0d-f9e627fef36f",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3177",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "它们是用什么手段控制住那些人的，你师父有猜测吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4478.400390625,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "49bc6645-8056-44dc-b20e-576c47feeeac",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3178",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊对，师父说本地教派的信仰者并没有这种控制它人的能力，而是以制作拥有奇特效用的织物闻名。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4807.2001953125,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "02d37923-a068-467a-8a51-fab7a2dbf82c",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3179",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "他猜测极乐戏团大概找到了什么方法扭曲了喜母的赐福，把丝线植入了人体，造成了那种类似人偶一样的异常转变。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5136.0,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e0b17fd9-418f-4b45-9068-21e6da1e4e6d",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3180",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "但考虑到信仰者能力的本质，这种外部植入的转变手段应该可以被停止和逆转，所以飞机上的人都还有救，只要我们能解决躲在头等舱的那个“偶师”。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5468.80029296875,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a262ae5e-736d-4b2d-97b9-16399de8f228",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3181",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "信仰者到底是？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5786.400390625,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5e5a4a65-efd1-47ef-a45b-3918e3347316",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3182",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊，信仰者简单来说就是通过信仰媒介获得了特殊能力或手段的人。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6104.80029296875,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ecdf76c6-525c-4d73-b933-84c4a0d67900",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3183",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "好，结合之前我这里收集到的线索。我已经有一些解决事件的思路了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6423.2001953125,
            "positionY": 164.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ec38e20f-f498-4bf1-ab77-b4f3f9ea698a",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3184",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6741.60009765625,
            "positionY": 165.60000610351563,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a097425e-856d-41aa-a494-8bc432ca6c85",
            "index": 21,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3185",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "稍等一下，我去借一个灭火器。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7068.0,
            "positionY": 163.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f53ece11-7f57-410c-bafe-2f09064167ca",
            "index": 22,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3186",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊？啊？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7396.80029296875,
            "positionY": 170.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "20ff939b-69dd-4cc9-8439-54ffc20e7ae9",
            "index": 23,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3187",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "对了，还有音响。周书，你也过来帮我拿一下吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7735.2001953125,
            "positionY": 172.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        }
